{
 "id": "rewrite/no-breakpoint/cut-inside-cache/5m",
 "description": "The body carries no cache_control. cmdfilter cuts message 2 from 3,000 to 600 tokens, inside the cached prefix. The provider reads 8,000 tokens (to message 1) and bills the rest as input. The 2,400 cut tokens were read before, so they are saved at the read rate, +2,400 x $0.30. The cut breaks the cache: the 18,600 tokens from message 1 to B* move from read to input.",
 "source": "more_examples.md#C2",
